{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1535,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66944b89e1d2a9f0d46aa0a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时我会思考为什么要创作故事……\r\n一定是因为想让以前的自己开心吧。\r\n那个爱做白日梦的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "deb50acdcd1a89a84acd00556c337b247c446aba67b3b230f7c7ede730c2ce9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf6d82c9714902ee3e14de92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前经常在沙滩上画画！\r\n刚画好原创角色的脸，\r\n就被海浪冲走消失了……啊哈哈……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e4c8fb5b06b0bfa0c5224f677fa136082dda0f62f768cdf12cee7b7f2135869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71ff67f4807b171216e70d0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是由我们两人共同描绘的、最棒的故事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23815e81f7dc444897bc222a6f0986e1125379b90eb9491a654c67cf435e3940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40dfc9d7b92ae8cd65eb24f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "堂堂完结！感谢您的阅读♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a3e63367fe654e5fe26a6dd72682d5d342ce8a9497d6a15eee70aeee7603c2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a918207b8604eccbc39464fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "注入斗魂！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbfb109ab0b188f6c68ec65d48e5e44e579e4f7edab94038d191dbab465ca7f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c6bc2d3de06b7a4386025c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想象力是没有极限的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69d051dbf1dd229a4ee61fa07880843d38b04439d7d6d4ec445c5b6c2c5b9c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60328a75ba5e0e115214c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是神业！让我们一起创作扣人心弦的故事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce5bba57caebc9a3e4bac28bdc215a9333401e188969350470e55674ed4d016e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c0919171dc5125d9fc86bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃尽灵魂的神业物语！\r\n我就是时代的主人公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ae224496d94a16d438a8ca204ae90b2d814c81e782eb6c4c89463d247544dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1137",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b24e2b3b2e65faad4852500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "协同效应拉满！",
      "source_fingerprint": "820d9e75b5a8944096a372a5897618a1a40f5c1fcc48d74508769bebc66d2f8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1138",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7816120df72b2573b1f2bb01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起来搞点“创新”吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "70223fb5a952d5585a367b85ec0f767f105f4b9fcbe2190f7d3d44acc87e8f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1138",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b17cb088bf3c63dfc67e1308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "设限之类的也太没意思了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af485318565adbe6fd5a4b1efd33b0e27c3223ab88fa19880ad65da7568bc4a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1138",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca47589dec666ab45a72df22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起激发协同效应吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb7fe7e1d53c005416c374b0ed95bbf2c2660ce3b89712e73234667938abaa8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd39e624b588a384edb8590c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要将哪场比赛定为目标呢？\n请结合赛马娘的适应性\n来决定吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a867c7f6eed11c79cbb78a2c2d9ecc9d5b8bda080c5f25d307107bedd82dc65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "23020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000ea52cec6003862cf1a945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "根据最终目标的不同，\r\n此前的参赛计划也会随之改变哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44944be12f22b7008c196fa4fee9ab0cab9c0d6fbc961a608b1fe784c428d454",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "23021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c1109e030d807d3217eba2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们将以目标BC赛事为前提制定计划。\r\n请慎重地做出决定吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25bac7df0b5e32bcd066d31342e03ca41f2faae948dc3b311fe5d8dcecd90efb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "23022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3c9f3c953e836e4df54c04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是所谓的伙伴关系，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90df9738aa533b26c876dcc54d8473233c66ca32cd9989d6385e486749312437",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd929027da69118d3f939982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是全面的业务提携！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afb3c44c7f8743f05897c41cd171dc12b492ea7eeca3768b38eddf2c61a0fbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1139",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f969240e0c9b3e8b6720de7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3382cddefb3b5851054894026cb53f29316b7430069927058d0134d0bb83b496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553485edbea6b452cb484fb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信着。若是和你一起，\n即便在悲伤之雨过后——也一定\n能让大家看见希望的天空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ac87ded4148dd31e6e7d87d04d55379b2f77560973e564e5513abbc64fbc0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d58f70d63107a980efb2b575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba97cb41e2262c84b02d770c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f102281bd0a55259bd28da4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一同迈步，连结羁绊…。\n正因为你这样对我说过，\n我才觉得自己能治愈所有孤独。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b2238188883f02e0cc23ba65410f511a9782cf72d33e5857ba50c97c275162",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b1be9124b4e4c8ec13ab029",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你之间的连结，为彼此\n带来了幸福…呵呵。愿这奇迹般的\n圆环，永远不会解开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f7a1c0bf753c72184484d8df566d1ede6a6ee9476006c0ee71d3e45ca7da88c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d5b72a7125f75f82c1cf3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正月我总是和家人一起度过。\n一边为他们揉肩，一边讲起学园的事，\n父母都会眯起眼睛微笑…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ef21dbe527057ddcd8be65dcdb8fdfe20a85c193075060d578eb01a37d3a57c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c230ae9c38919735345ecc3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和创升同学、景致同学\n一起做了巧克力。愿笑容的圆环\n能在大家之间扩展开来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "492ade8019d276c865b6b626bd6ceb01c91b65bc61f8d737d135109a95b8861e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72fac732d3dfabc3d4a32cb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把对你的心意做成了\n缎带形状的巧克力。愿我们结下的牵绊\n永远不会松开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aecb835275fea9825de09332e0d0a3a9018f4f094017ef2f42fc48935d91d79b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f949e21c5d9cc4965d94c924",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿织女和彦星无论何时都能相会——\n愿连结两人的桥梁，\n无论如何都不要消失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bff2af44ba9eb5ac99f84ac78c7a2fed352840b72ea651373d0dd4c1d40add25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bff0b02da511d9514f15b9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说今天，是已经无法再见的人\n会在一夜之间归来的日子。\n温柔又…总觉得很温暖呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22eb5fe9ac6c14b8bf1232e575c6958bee54ca70bd570e1482dd1d69b59b154e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec134a0df6c46662337700d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和荣进闪耀同学\n烤了德式姜饼。还聊了\n各种海外点心的事…呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83b3869a43b0b2956d9a1def4ae7ef80be76a105662b192d9d522c48e84bbca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa81a97a41ebc40febcf8c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿我与你之间的连结，\n也能像装点圣夜的圣诞花环一样…\n一直延续下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c289c46e94b079fe98e47062da4cbca6e317409609f5d7717e40c30b0c96286",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e35137f420b33ac26bdebe8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做到了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32aef7ba1f969ebda52d7bea37a777d96121b1a4336da65f31a44bd63a7c800a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42cf72da84aeaa57de733cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末似乎会有很多人感到寂寞。\n所以我一定会逐一问候大家，\n祈愿他们心中能点起一丝火光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af45d81c3effaf0a00d6a8bfe2afbad2f190c424f1e7b41dca7f4fe07e87dcc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ef6711bb2b0d637371603f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\n愿今天这个日子，被思念着你的\n笑容之环填满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f08142c21150203a029f2aabbf45f4e3f3334d8d4790670c9f6b54d9f126c9f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f3fc44facf5f4985c65f25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能看到你以笑容\n迎来这一刻…。能成为那笑容之环\n的一部分，我感到很高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3f371aefe4a51d15ba1592c51808ea036fc26d3d0421938221cbb1403d9d5a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380c0c69b9f27a60e424c518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新宇宙同学她们在生日会上\n送了我一块仿宝石的蛋糕♪\n呵呵…吃的时候，我还有些紧张呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2169fd1babc136383ca4e98b21e3fb4d846bd5afbcc47d4511d08f43bf3b74b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c472cead31a89a03d1f4ad8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你能像这样陪在我身边——\n仅仅如此，就让这个日子\n变得更加温暖了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6f48b6254aefc4d1230866ad8c8b10386a06bbe87693f3fbe2cdbef776c0402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba062604f583f1d2fa8ff14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知送到了哦。\n如果可以的话，我能在旁边\n一起看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6c113c211beba3785017d9dd42be3b22490da1fa62a5957dc43e42e5e287622",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ebe0203a5fe33231492a7b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎有礼物送到了。\n我想，那一定是为了祝福\n努力着的你而送来的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a246159af553fc86ecf41d08be383a442893e0f72a15157cb8b07f148384d15e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:434d366ac5e5cb9897f8bb81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵…任务达成，\n恭喜你。\n真是非常出色的表现呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51241013e25c151025b2dcdc65995ad2b98488d61b979f7584c4cf204b088f14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b91a5d51ac342927a932f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎要开始了呢。\n如果你要着手准备的话，\n也能让我帮忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68918123f3122c0ae90cad0ccb39358d8fac66079735b325728d53e74836d7f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18fcc9910ee5b94f6ad318e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了呢。\n愿这段时间，能连结到你的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e65bb295bd4778e18d3a138d6aeb3af6a424771ceee4c8d3cb26501171899dab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c566130ccc7dd9afc3709e13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我不会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5fa7540555444c82759f24414deaab44863314206951ba3154973181096edf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b96f1dc57daeb0b16c0abcc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了呢。\n你的努力结出了成果…\n我也非常高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "064998033bf67825cf92de832ccb45d04d1caa69cab01af72323adb7e0cd8671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b85f9651833f7ff48f06f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢设计简洁的服装。\n穿上后总觉得背脊会挺直，\n连心也变得澄澈起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f85309bb2186672474a16b07b2b37339d73bce65bd67fecfa2733cfe849093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d9882341a4920a57f80da45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在电车上经常会和邻座的人聊天。\n哪怕只是短短几句话，\n也会觉得彼此的心靠近了…很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "420cebade8ee9a575a0b3af556f1b58f8b1dc26282c60f98ad896158a4cef170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2d8ad3886fb6556a2056a92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息日我常常会去逛美术馆。\n尤其会被以希望和光为主题的画作\n深深吸引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d081dd80869e188ad7255482002ecc7b1277f43df9851e40136e6974a9efde83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a4cdcf0d4c75046ca56274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再一起跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "530ed84e0582e9a0cbb9d7a32b8348282a815715ae7c323bf067c746b5aff5f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1896387f26e398b97388e127",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df40836527fa18e0f0dd5666950e1463686e6432d814f80a0d2367da2797d2ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:925bf8c95faebfe4d72238ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我不会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5fa7540555444c82759f24414deaab44863314206951ba3154973181096edf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869df34b9033b3c7df178071",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再一起跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "530ed84e0582e9a0cbb9d7a32b8348282a815715ae7c323bf067c746b5aff5f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a281d067a5c2b6fc3fc6ad30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新纪录了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd54b5d65ed7ad95de265a239cd7e0357feca6ed137778f4af2090df7519eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d15e8f4b08d3905fa4f1b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一同连结吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8383376008e49813ed0e63f72d4ea4e7119fbe1ed14941a5419a2d7e67601e8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4900b050db5e2074b22d56e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2efea544bdb85034d353bab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要进行怎样的训练呢？\n如果有想尝试的菜单，\n请告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4280a227443b91f56c2ae979209e086639f381f0be3150f29c9165b6cb63ae19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d0154d3f108f7ff96129b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这所学园中累积起来的\n无数牵绊…。我想感受一下\n那份温暖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "581b6181f013f1bb20105088613b86417d0fede7638ecb19271f8766846e166b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e5744f0feedce1c9b45803c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是在准备出赛吧。\n愿你的心意，\n能连结到好的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b391e6ddecd129903a4534a1c842c0c4d276f56cb940a3e18e16831075ae3262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b575c3500d296bf18c472dc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f15c100e8261a112083484a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会连结起来。也连同大家的心意——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f89af9d2d15830de4aff40d611ff15724494ed9eb37ffc88a35b1d5fa2cdd5ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96751c8476c389703fbb23de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望之光——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61f4ac9b3c66ca5fc3fd95b45b14007c5860d43190a0719140defdfbc106ad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1260"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:733f71caeba6c5a10ca29c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将心连结起来……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "267de4b0e412bea961733398901acbdce0231ffcdeeb04e36d45184d2ce356e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:332f3c9000b37a84fcf17fd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31ad862afe505f7a0e3caf5d40108bddc33091f1c5054820028b7df74bd09a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284f53501faff6dc26c8492b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dce43a1e83db8317414d94819a56690e2f8869762928420aca26a49bd4a3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a51429caf7ae6b11264eb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真精彩呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "139cb945baffad055ccf5e415bfd67947a3ee6c44e99c8bc22ecda433572c96b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
